sequenceDiagram
    box Upload
        participant C as Client
        participant AGW as API Gateway
        participant API as API Lambda
        participant S3in as S3 (input)
    end
    participant DDB as DynamoDB
    participant EB as EventBridge
    participant DP as Document Processor
    participant S3out as S3 (output)
    participant Textract
    box BDA path
        participant BDA
        participant RP as Result Processor
    end
    box OCR / LLM mapping
        participant OCRQ as OCR Mapping Queue
        participant OCRP as OCR Mapping Processor
        participant Bedrock as Bedrock (LLM)
    end
    box Metrics
        participant SQS
        participant MP as Metrics Processor
        participant S3m as S3 (metrics, Parquet)
    end

    C->>AGW: POST /v1/documents
    AGW->>API: invoke
    API->>S3in: put object
    API->>DDB: write metadata
    API-->>C: 202 job_id
    S3in->>EB: ObjectCreated
    EB->>DP: invoke

    rect rgba(0, 150, 110, 0.10)
        Note over DDB,SQS: Primary extraction path<br/>If identity document (textract-identity-enabled)
        DP->>Textract: AnalyzeID
        Textract-->>DP: identity fields
        DP->>S3out: write result
        DP->>DDB: classify + update status + fields
        DP->>SQS: emit metrics
        Note over DDB,SQS: Otherwise (textract-identity-disabled, non-identity documents, or AnalyzeID fell through)
        DP->>BDA: InvokeDataAutomationAsync
        BDA->>S3out: write result
        S3out->>EB: ObjectCreated
        EB->>RP: invoke
        RP->>DDB: update status + fields
        RP->>SQS: emit metrics
    end

    rect rgba(130, 90, 220, 0.10)
        Note over DDB,SQS: OCR / LLM mapping path runs alongside the primary path<br/>(ocr-mapping-enabled or is_compare, blueprint type matched)
        DP->>Textract: AnalyzeDocument (layout)
        Textract-->>DP: OCR blocks
        DP->>S3out: write OCR blocks
        DP->>OCRQ: enqueue request (S3 URI)
        Note over OCRQ,Bedrock: Asynchronous, after the Document Processor returns
        OCRQ->>OCRP: invoke
        OCRP->>S3out: read OCR blocks
        OCRP->>Bedrock: map fields via LLM
        Bedrock-->>OCRP: extracted fields
        OCRP->>S3out: write ocr-mapping result
        OCRP->>DDB: write ocr-mapping result
    end

    SQS->>MP: invoke
    MP->>S3m: write Parquet
